# @name Gazebo teTra_mk-7_EM3
#
# @type Standard VTOL
#

# Mk-7 EM3 (Gazebo model teTra_mk-7_EM3): EM2 outer shape with the 2026-10-29 measured CG, 1560 kg,
# lift-rotor thrust coefficient 0.0424 (EM2 0.0371) and the beta 26 deg pusher (0.0556, EM2 0.0443).
# Derived from 22001 (EM2); only the values below differ:
#   CA_ROTORn_PX/PY/PZ  rotor positions relative to the whole-vehicle CG (+0.221, +0.010, +0.198 in the model frame)
#   CA_ROTOR12_KM       pusher moment coefficient 0.231 (model momentConstant)
#   SIM_GZ_EC_MAX13     pusher max speed 249.6 rad/s (model maxRotVelocity)
#   MPC_THR_HOVER, VT_LIFT_HND_THR  0.42: thrust per rotor 15304 N/(12 cos 8 deg)=1288 N -> omega 174.3 rad/s
#                       -> u=(174.3-37.38)/211.85=0.646 -> T=u^2=0.42 (the same arithmetic gives 0.49 for EM2)
# CA_AIRFRAME stays 22001: same rotor/surface layout, values come from the CA_* parameters.

