# 0.46 m below the origin: 0.34 m above the ground when parked. First try at 0.62 m below: after touchdown the radar was
# inside its minimum range, dist_bottom stayed at 1.6 m and the land detector never confirmed the landing. Without a range sensor the landing slowdown used the height above HOME (FlightTask::_evaluateDistanceToGround):
# at a pad 54 m above home the vehicle still came down at 3 m/s (HQ01 runs 2-4, 0.2-2.8 m/s touchdowns).
param set-default EKF2_RNG_CTRL 1  # conditional: range as height reference near the ground, terrain estimate always
